OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe day will continue dry. Most
OL,6,Fplaces will see sunny periods but it
OL,7,Fwill be cloudy in the west at times.
OL,8,FThis cloud will clear later in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMost places stay dry
OL,12,Fovernight but clear periods in the
OL,13,Fevening will decrease as thickening
OL,14,Fcloud spreads southeast. This brings
OL,15,Fpatchy light rain to the north and
OL,16,Fwest towards morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
