OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FCloudy with patchy light
OL,6,Frain in the north and west at first,
OL,7,Fsoon becoming drier and brighter.
OL,8,FFurther cloudy and light rain spread
OL,9,Fsoutheast from the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry and
OL,12,Fbright with sunny spells Sunday and
OL,13,FMonday. Patchy light rain in the east
OL,14,Fbut dry west Tuesday. The chance of
OL,15,Ffog Monday morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
